<%- include('partials/header') %>

    <body class="public-page">
        <%- include('partials/public-nav') %>

            <main class="info-page">
                <div class="info-inner info-legal">
                    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p class="info-sub">Last updated: September 1, 2024</p>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                        <p>We collect information you provide directly when creating an account, including your name,
                            email address, phone number, and password. We also collect transaction data, account
                            activity, and usage information to provide and improve our services.</p>
                        <h3>Personal Information</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Full legal name</li>
                            <li>Email address</li>
                            <li>Phone number</li>
                            <li>Account credentials (stored in hashed form only)</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h3>Financial Information</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Account balances and transaction history</li>
                            <li>Transfer records and payment details</li>
                            <li>Card information (last four digits only)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                        <p>Your information is used to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our banking services</li>
                            <li>Process transactions and send related notifications</li>
                            <li>Verify your identity and prevent fraud</li>
                            <li>Comply with legal and regulatory requirements</li>
                            <li>Communicate with you about account activity and updates</li>
                            <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve user experience</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>3. Data Protection</h2>
                        <p>We implement robust security measures to protect your data:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Passwords are hashed using bcrypt and never stored in plaintext</li>
                            <li>All data transmissions are encrypted using TLS/SSL</li>
                            <li>CSRF protection on all state-changing operations</li>
                            <li>Rate limiting to prevent brute-force attacks</li>
                            <li>Regular security audits and vulnerability assessments</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
                        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Regulatory authorities as required by law</li>
                            <li>Law enforcement agencies in response to valid legal requests</li>
                            <li>Service providers who assist in operating our platform (subject to strict
                                confidentiality agreements)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
                        <p>You have the right to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Access your personal data at any time through your account settings</li>
                            <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
                            <li>Request deletion of your account and associated data</li>
                            <li>Receive a copy of your data in a portable format</li>
                            <li>Opt out of non-essential communications</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
                        <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active and for a reasonable period
                            thereafter to comply with legal, tax, and regulatory obligations. Transaction records are
                            retained for a minimum of seven years as required by financial regulations.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="info-section">
                        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
                        <p>For privacy-related inquiries, contact our Data Protection Officer at
                            <strong>privacy@willowbank.com</strong> or write to us at 1200 Willow Avenue, Suite 400, San
                            Francisco, CA 94105.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
    </body>

    </html>